## Sender (engine 2) LTP config.
##
## Mirrored ring names: node 2's TX is 'ring_2to3' (same name node 3 will
## open as its RX); node 2's RX is 'ring_3to2'.  Both endpoints reference
## the same SHM object name for a given direction (no .tx/.rx suffix).
##
## Span parameters (matches bench-ltp baseline so results are comparable):
##   peer engine id           : 3
##   max export sessions      : 8
##   max import sessions      : 8
##   max segment size         : 64000  (must be <= XLSA_BUFSZ = 1048576)
##   aggregation size limit   : 128000
##   aggregation time limit   : 1 sec
1 50
a span 3 8 8 64000 128000 1 'xlso shm:ring_2to3 3'
s 'xlsi shm:ring_3to2'
